{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-11-03 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES COMMERCIAL AVAILABILITY OF GMP-GRADE PROTEINS FROM DEDICATED GMP FACILITY', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, NOV. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMMERCIAL AVAILABILITY OF GMP-GRADE MATERIALS MANUFACTURED AT \xa0ITS ST. PAUL, MN GMP (GOOD MANUFACTURING PRACTICES) MANUFACTURING FACILITY. THE FACILITY IS DEDICATED TO SUPPORTING LARGE-SCALE PRODUCTION OF GMP-GRADE PROTEINS, INCLUDING ANIMAL-FREE CYTOKINES AND GROWTH FACTORS, THAT ARE ESSENTIAL COMPONENTS OF CELL CULTURE MEDIA FOR IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY, REGENERATIVE MEDICINE AND GENE-MODIFIED CELL THERAPY WORKFLOWS.'}